          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "దుర్ఘటన — durghaṭana — \"a tragic accident; a disaster\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ఆ దుర్ఘటన నిన్న సాయంత్రం జరిగింది. ā durghaṭana ninna sāyantraṁ jarigindi. That tragic accident happened yesterday evening."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "దుర్-, ill, with ఘటన, a happening: compare సంఘటన."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "దుర్ఘటన (durghaṭana) is built from Sanskrit dur-, \"ill, bad\", and ghaṭana, \"a joining, a coming together\" (Monier-Williams)."
            }
          ]
        },
