          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "బయటపడు — bayaṭapaḍu — \"to get out; to come to light\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "మంటల నుంచి అందరూ క్షేమంగా బయటపడ్డారు. maṇṭala nuñci andarū kṣēmaṅgā bayaṭapaḍḍāru. Everyone got out of the fire safely."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): బయటపడ్డాను, bayaṭapaḍḍānu."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "బయట, outside, with పడు: to come out, or for a secret to come out."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "బయటపడు (bayaṭapaḍu) is a native compound: bayaṭa, \"outside\", which sits beside bayalu, \"the outside, open space\" (DEDR 3940), with the helping verb paḍu."
            }
          ]
        },
